+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to evict cache entries using an LRU (Least Recently Used) policy combined with a 300-second TTL (time-to-live). The recorded rationale is that LRU with a TTL is cleaner and easier to reason about, and it gives predictable eviction semantics.
